<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><B>PROPOSAL 5: </B>To ratify, confirm and approve
the appointment of Audit Alliance LLP as the Company&rsquo;s independent registered public accounting firm for the fiscal year ending
June 30, 2024 (the &ldquo;<B>Ratification of Appointment of Auditors Proposal</B>&rdquo;); Ratification of the Appointment of Auditors
Proposal to be approved as an ordinary resolution;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 29.7pt 0pt 0; text-align: justify"></P>

